   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If agents on the other side are still running, the switch waits\n(retry every 20 s, up to an hour) - a model is never pulled out\nfrom under a running agent. Shows up as wait_seconds.",
   "originalText": "If agents on the other side are still running, the switch waits\n(retry every 20 s, up to an hour) - a model is never pulled out\nfrom under a running agent. Shows up as wait_seconds.",
